      "value": "A few of the things you mentioned have been requested already:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/custom-animator-controllers-on-humanoid-avatars\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/remove-duration-limit-on-emote-animations-cancel-animations-via-locomotion\nPlease separate the rest into individual posts, so that they can be found and tracked easily.",
