  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-10T00:08:08.610Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC Trigger could have an Avatar variant that allows things such as sound on particle collision/Player collision, and maybe some of the features that already exist in the world variant but limited.\n\nThe VRC Ik follower script needs some adjustments and maybe an option to set what bone to follow similar to how Final-Ik's Limb ik script works\n\nThe Ability to adjust your avatars camera with an animation, maybe with a script.\n\nCustom Humanoid controllers, Expansion on the gesture override controller to allow things such as separate hand animations.\n\nAnd last but not least, Longer Emotes. \n\n- Unari",
